<title>USA: NYNEX, Bell Atlantic proxy reviewed.</title>
<headline>NYNEX, Bell Atlantic proxy reviewed.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merger partners NYNEX Corp and Bell Atlantic Corp said on Monday the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission had completed its review of the joint proxy statement and merger prospectus.</p>
<p>The companies say they expect to complete their merger as early as January 1.</p>
<p>Mailings to shareholders will begin on September 18 and shareholder meetings will be held on November 6 for NYNEX and November 8 for Bell Atlantic.</p>
<p>-- Nick Louth, New York Newsroom 212 859 1712</p>
</text>
